    "## 8. Giai thich khong dung Softmax\n",
    "\n",
    "Lop output tra ve **logits** (gia tri tho), khong ap dung `Softmax`\n",
    "ben trong `forward()`. Ly do:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `nn.CrossEntropyLoss` (loss chuan cho bai toan multi-class) da tu\n",
    "  ket hop san `LogSoftmax` + `NLLLoss` ben trong. Neu ap dung them\n",
    "  `Softmax` truoc khi dua vao `CrossEntropyLoss`, phep chuan hoa se bi\n",
    "  lap lai 2 lan, lam sai lech gradient va anh huong toi qua trinh\n",
    "  train.\n",
    "- Tinh `LogSoftmax` gop chung voi loss on dinh ve mat so hoc hon la\n",
    "  tach rieng `Softmax` roi lay log, vi tranh duoc cac gia tri xac suat\n",
    "  qua nho hoac qua lon (numerical stability).\n",
    "- Khi du doan (inference), chi can lay `argmax` tren logits la ra lop\n",
    "  du doan, vi `Softmax` la phep bien doi don dieu (monotonic) nen\n",
    "  khong lam thay doi thu tu logit lon nhat.\n"
   ]
