    "## 11. Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "- Da mo ta va cai dat MLP voi kien truc `784 -> 128 -> 64 -> 10`, dung\n",
    "  `Flatten` de chuyen anh `28x28` thanh vector 784 chieu, va `ReLU`\n",
    "  lam ham kich hoat giua cac lop `Linear`.\n",
    "- Model duoc khoi tao va kien truc duoc in ra de kiem tra dung nhu\n",
    "  thiet ke.\n",
    "- **Input shape**: `[batch, 1, 28, 28]` truoc Flatten, thanh\n",
    "  `[batch, 784]` sau Flatten.\n",
    "- **Output shape**: `[batch, 10]`, dung 10 logits cho moi anh.\n",
    "- Da dem duoc tong so **trainable parameters** cua tung lop.\n",
    "- Da giai thich ro vi sao **khong dung Softmax** trong `forward()`.\n",
    "- Da viet **ham save model** va **ham load model**, kiem tra lai output\n",
    "  giong nhau truoc/sau khi load - xac nhan luu/nap trong so dung.\n",
    "\n",
    "Model nay da san sang de dua vao vong lap training (forward -> loss ->\n",
    "backward -> optimize) o buoc tiep theo cua Practice 1.\n"
   ]
